{"4634070": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Memories of the Pinewood Islands", "steam_appid": 4634070, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "dlc": [4635140], "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4634070/extras/d7677f508b641e5f8339b5fcd60a8032.avif?t=1778766408\" width=780 height=180 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >“Memories of the Pinewood Islands” is a cozy and slightly comedic walking sim, detective mystery and treasure hunting game. Play as Sir Ulrich Ravenscroft, a young nobleman and second son to a penniless baron who seeks a position at the court of the good King Harold to improve his standing in life. In order to do so, he has been given a mission to investigate the mysterious Pinewood Islands, find the Viscount Eklund, the missing liege lord, and work out precisely what happened to the inhabitants of the towns and villages that peppered this region.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4634070/extras/d9b56398bc380841c18013dcc060ab1e.avif?t=1778766408\" width=780 height=180 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Explore the hauntingly beautiful Pinewood Islands and uncover the secrets of its residents</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Read the letters of townsfolk and nobles alike and see how their delicate interpersonal relationships affected their day-to-day lives</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Enjoy gorgeous piano and guitar music as you freely explore this vast open world.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Listen to key audio memories magically etched into mystical stones.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use the clues you find to find the treasures hidden in this ethereal region to return to the good King Harold and claim a title in his expanding Kingdom.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4634070/extras/cde644cd37e0c0669ef7568bafb6a07b.poster.avif?t=1778766408\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4634070/extras/cde644cd37e0c0669ef7568bafb6a07b.webm?t=1778766408\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4634070/extras/cde644cd37e0c0669ef7568bafb6a07b.mp4?t=1778766408\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4634070/extras/d7677f508b641e5f8339b5fcd60a8032.avif?t=1778766408\" width=780 height=180 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >“Memories of the Pinewood Islands” is a cozy and slightly comedic walking sim, detective mystery and treasure hunting game. Play as Sir Ulrich Ravenscroft, a young nobleman and second son to a penniless baron who seeks a position at the court of the good King Harold to improve his standing in life. In order to do so, he has been given a mission to investigate the mysterious Pinewood Islands, find the Viscount Eklund, the missing liege lord, and work out precisely what happened to the inhabitants of the towns and villages that peppered this region.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4634070/extras/d9b56398bc380841c18013dcc060ab1e.avif?t=1778766408\" width=780 height=180 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Explore the hauntingly beautiful Pinewood Islands and uncover the secrets of its residents</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Read the letters of townsfolk and nobles alike and see how their delicate interpersonal relationships affected their day-to-day lives</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Enjoy gorgeous piano and guitar music as you freely explore this vast open world.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Listen to key audio memories magically etched into mystical stones.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use the clues you find to find the treasures hidden in this ethereal region to return to the good King Harold and claim a title in his expanding Kingdom.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4634070/extras/cde644cd37e0c0669ef7568bafb6a07b.poster.avif?t=1778766408\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4634070/extras/cde644cd37e0c0669ef7568bafb6a07b.webm?t=1778766408\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4634070/extras/cde644cd37e0c0669ef7568bafb6a07b.mp4?t=1778766408\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>", "short_description": "&quot;Memories of the Pinewood Islands&quot; is a cozy walking sim and treasure hunting game where you explore the hauntingly gorgeous Pinewood Islands in search of some missing artefacts belonging to the Good King Harold. Immerse yourself in this rich and ethereal world to solve the realm's greatest mystery,", "supported_languages": "English<strong>*</strong><br><strong>*</strong>languages with ful